--
-- What reference/revisions/golden.sh adds to the default install and
-- deletes after, as WordPress would store it: an editor, user 2; the
-- administrator's post with three revisions (one of user 2's) and user 2's
-- autosave; a page whose first revision has no title; a post with one
-- revision; a post saved since its last revision; a post whose newest is an
-- autosave; user 2's post; a post user 2 holds the edit lock of; and the
-- edges: a revision without its post, a synced pattern's, one by a user
-- gone, a draft with only autosaves, and revisions saved with their post
-- at once, in date order and not.
